<!-- ===================== OUR PROCESS SECTION ===================== -->
<style>
  .process-section {
    padding: 4rem 2rem;
    min-height: 100vh;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    justify-content: center;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .process-section .process-header {
    text-align: center;
    max-width: 700px;
    margin: 0 auto 4rem auto;
  }

  .process-section .process-header h2 {
    font-size: clamp(2.5rem, 4vw, 3.5rem);
    font-weight: 700;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    letter-spacing: -1px;
  }
  .process-section .process-header h2 span { color: #FACC15; }

  .process-section .process-header p {
    font-size: 1.125rem;
    color: #6B7280;
  }

  .process-section .cards-row {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(5, 1fr);
    gap: 1.25rem;
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 1400px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .process-section .process-card {
    --card-bg: #F3F4F6;
    --card-text: #111111;
    --card-desc: #6B7280;
    --icon-color: #6B7280;

    background-color: var(--card-bg);
    color: var(--card-text);
    border-radius: 20px;
    padding: 2rem 1.5rem;
    text-align: left;
    border: 1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.03);
    box-shadow: 0 4px 10px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.02);
    transition: transform 0.3s ease, box-shadow 0.3s ease, border-color 0.3s ease;
    will-change: transform, background-color, color, opacity;
    opacity: 1;
  }

  .process-section .process-card:hover {
    transform: translateY(-8px);
    box-shadow: 0 15px 30px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08);
    border-color: #FACC15;
  }

  .process-section .card-icon {
    width: 50px; height: 50px; margin-bottom: 1.5rem; color: var(--icon-color);
  }
  .process-section .card-icon svg {
    width: 100%; height: 100%; fill: none; stroke: currentColor;
    stroke-width: 1.5; stroke-linecap: round; stroke-linejoin: round;
  }

  .process-section .process-card h3 {
    font-size: 1.25rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 0.75rem; letter-spacing: -0.5px;
  }
  .process-section .process-card p {
    font-size: 0.9rem; color: var(--card-desc); line-height: 1.5;
  }

  @media (max-width: 1023px) {
    .process-section { min-height: auto; }
    .process-section .cards-row { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); }
    .process-section .process-card { padding: 2.5rem 2rem; }
    .process-section .process-card h3 { font-size: 1.4rem; }
    .process-section .process-card p { font-size: 1rem; }
  }

  @media (max-width: 600px) {
    .process-section .cards-row { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
  }
</style>

<section class="process-section">
  <div class="process-header">
    <h2 class="proc-gsap-title">Our Proven <span>Process</span></h2>
    <p class="proc-gsap-sub">A step-by-step methodology to transform your digital presence. We merge strategy, execution, and analytics to drive consistent growth.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="cards-row">
    <div class="process-card proc-gsap-card">
      <div class="card-icon">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M10 10m-7 0a7 7 0 1 0 14 0a7 7 0 1 0 -14 0" /><path d="M21 21l-6 -6" /><path d="M10 13v.01" /><path d="M10 7v3" /></svg>
      </div>
      <h3>1. Audit</h3>
      <p>We analyze your current footprint, identifying critical bottlenecks and immediate areas for performance enhancement.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="process-card proc-gsap-card">
      <div class="card-icon">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 12m-1 0a1 1 0 1 0 2 0a1 1 0 1 0 -2 0" /><path d="M12 12m-5 0a5 5 0 1 0 10 0a5 5 0 1 0 -10 0" /><path d="M12 12m-9 0a9 9 0 1 0 18 0a9 9 0 1 0 -18 0" /><path d="M15 15l6 6" /></svg>
      </div>
      <h3>2. Strategy</h3>
      <p>We develop a data-driven roadmap tailored strictly to your goals, outlining the exact campaigns and funnels required.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="process-card proc-gsap-card">
      <div class="card-icon">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M21 12l-9 5l-9 -5l9 -5l9 5" /><path d="M21 17l-9 5l-9 -5" /><path d="M3 12l0 -5l9 -5l9 5l0 5" /></svg>
      </div>
      <h3>3. Build</h3>
      <p>Our team constructs high-converting landing pages, robust automation systems, and striking digital ad assets.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="process-card proc-gsap-card">
      <div class="card-icon">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M3 12h1m8 -9v1m8 8h1m-15.4 -6.4l.7 .7m12.1 -.7l-.7 .7" /><path d="M9 16a5 5 0 1 1 6 0a3.5 3.5 0 0 0 -1 3a2 2 0 0 1 -4 0a3.5 3.5 0 0 0 -1 -3" /><path d="M9.7 17l4.6 0" /></svg>
      </div>
      <h3>4. Knowledge</h3>
      <p>We launch campaigns while gathering insights, testing variations, and refining target demographics in real-time.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="process-card proc-gsap-card">
      <div class="card-icon">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M4 19l16 0" /><path d="M4 15l4 -6l4 2l4 -5l4 4" /></svg>
      </div>
      <h3>5. Overview</h3>
      <p>Complete transparency and optimization. We provide thorough reporting to scale the strategies with the highest ROI.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
